    {
      "id": "coalesced:3bcbb517d9039e362970d6c1e92437a1e7e54f47ad847907408c20b1e19fb537",
      "source": "바람의 상태이상에는\\n'어지러움'과 '침묵'이 있어.",
      "source_sha256": "67a12ae7003dcff99970ad19b6e0d9e27ed07dbaf421561f49eecedf6d679377",
      "before_translation": "风属性的异常状态，有“眩晕”和“沉默”。",
      "translation": "风属性的异常状态，有“晕眩”和“沉默”。",
      "translation_sha256": "eaf111b9f78ec8a8ef0055cd114679d3596093d12e6839e37171b4e20b620e1f",
      "reason": "Wind-status tutorial explicitly describes decreased agility/evasion;reuse existing skill晕眩 for어지러움 while distinctスタン/스턴 remains眩晕",
      "status": "source-grounded-draft-correction"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b18b44f4683ea74aacf390b69e5d297791cd9afaba52e01badce6729313804fd",
      "source": "어지러움에 걸리면 민첩함이 감소하고,\\n회피율도 떨어지게 돼.",
      "source_sha256": "e917777e3a92bb721fbf18f792bc3ef603b9dd07555cddb8bacc836b8e0c33e4",
      "before_translation": "陷入眩晕后，敏捷会降低，回避率也会下降。",
      "translation": "陷入晕眩后，敏捷会降低，回避率也会下降。",
      "translation_sha256": "9b6391398f32f0651b123b5439d34e94c485ed4b87e1aad6fa8ab727c18b70ea",
      "reason": "Wind-status tutorial explicitly describes decreased agility/evasion;reuse existing skill晕眩 for어지러움 while distinctスタン/스턴 remains眩晕",
      "status": "source-grounded-draft-correction"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:aeb0ed12bc8e962ee72320539944635366c232dfa299cd72ae0ea599d5ca44aa",
      "source": "그리고 어지러움보다 한 단계 높은 상태이상이 침묵인데,\\n침묵에 걸리면 스킬을 못 쓰게 돼.",
      "source_sha256": "6e8c2127b63cb6b31c77e50c9dc9c95d193b4af6285ada6a4d5ad7ed9597bbcb",
      "before_translation": "沉默是比眩晕更严重一阶段的异常状态，陷入沉默后就没法使用技能。",
      "translation": "沉默是比晕眩更严重一阶段的异常状态，陷入沉默后就没法使用技能。",
      "translation_sha256": "27e3eba06377021e786f6adf8d3f0d2ce8e63bcee23335b7f81d4a5a4eb0d6f3",
      "reason": "Wind-status tutorial explicitly describes decreased agility/evasion;reuse existing skill晕眩 for어지러움 while distinctスタン/스턴 remains眩晕",
      "status": "source-grounded-draft-correction"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:51c984b0e63b036c1a501caa2109e16d9f62c82d92ee5bc358b4a5a34ef6aa6c",
      "source": "어지러움에 걸리면\\n침묵에 걸릴 확률이 더 높아지니까\\n가능하면 빨리 치료하는 게 좋아.",
      "source_sha256": "714bd7cc97ad7cd9743f2042050b2868baf9d296ad5f0f7daf51f90e43471d47",
      "before_translation": "处于眩晕状态时，更容易进一步陷入沉默，所以最好尽快治疗。",
      "translation": "处于晕眩状态时，更容易进一步陷入沉默，所以最好尽快治疗。",
      "translation_sha256": "e51dad44ac3c82823706bb669d7936e931869d44cf68644fcef00a682d1f6887",
      "reason": "Wind-status tutorial explicitly describes decreased agility/evasion;reuse existing skill晕眩 for어지러움 while distinctスタン/스턴 remains眩晕",
