      "translation_sha256": "69a9e789133a991a9047ff273f413d149386970516706acbf562072eeac74f55",
      "reason": "Wind-status tutorial explicitly describes decreased agility/evasion;reuse existing skill晕眩 for어지러움 while distinctスタン/스턴 remains眩晕",
      "status": "source-grounded-draft-correction"
